                                        "entry_id": "10406250-13ea-3bf0-bb52-ee0399163979",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pentahydric alcohol, C₅H₁₂O₅, penta-hydroxy pentane; derived from xylose; used as a sweetener."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
